        "content": "<p>We have <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Submodule.mem_iSup_iff_exists_dfinsupp%27#doc\">docs#Submodule.mem_iSup_iff_exists_dfinsupp'</a>. However, are you sure you can't just use an induction principle instead, like <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Submodule.iSup_induction#doc\">docs#Submodule.iSup_induction</a></p>",
